{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:13.28] In my hotel, saw a gate to hell\n[00:15.88] So gone, I couldn't talk or make a scream for help\n[00:19.30] A lot about that realm I don't know well\n[00:22.52] But I was way too high to give a fuck if you couldn't tell\n[Post-Chorus]\n[00:26.64] Drug dealers dealin' out potions\n[00:29.74] Some codeine, some coke ones\n[00:33.04] Demons mixin' in with your emotions\n[00:35.78] But only so long can you still run\n[Verse 1]\n[00:39.02] I've been losin' focus\n[00:42.64] I've been losin' hope\n[00:45.44] Feelin' hopeless and motionless, motionless\n[00:51.16] I've been losin' focus\n[00:55.88] I've been losin' hope\n[00:58.66] Feelin' hopeless and motionless, motionless\n[Verse 2]\n[01:05.76] Popped four more pills, go hard to go home right\n[01:10.94] I finally found my home right, love of my life\n[01:15.88] So now I gotta stop goin' so hard\n[01:19.24] But I'm the hottest thing smokin', no jokin'\n[01:22.42] Addiction, I don't provoke it, there's no jokin'\n[01:25.56] My friends ask me what it feels like to have your soul stolen\n[01:28.86] I don't know, jokes on the devil, I still want it\n[Chorus]\n[01:33.04] In my hotel, saw a gate to hell\n[01:35.34] So gone, I couldn't talk or make a scream for help\n[01:38.78] A lot about that realm I don't know well\n[01:41.98] But I was way too high to give a fuck if you couldn't tell\n[Post-Chorus]\n[01:46.12] Drug dealers dealin' out potions\n[01:49.18] Some codeine, some coke ones\n[01:52.54] Demons mixin' in with your emotions\n[01:55.26] But only so long can you still run\n[Verse 3]\n[01:59.42] Time, did it, I didn't\n[02:04.06] I hate to break the news\n[02:05.34] But your God is strict and the devil isn't\n[02:10.52] But here's another clue\n[02:12.04] Only one of them is omniscience\n[02:16.20] Ooh, so what am I missin'?\n[02:19.00] Livin' in hell, judgment day\n[02:21.90] Did I miss it?\n[02:25.16] Fuck no, dawg, I'm too high up\n[02:28.54] Yeah, the devil fly, but I'm flyer\n[02:31.20] I know you see these dollar signs in my fire\n[02:34.56] I know you see these Louis prints in my dryer\n[Chorus]\n[02:38.96] In my hotel, saw a gate to hell\n[02:41.54] So gone, I couldn't talk or make a scream for help\n[02:44.98] A lot about that realm I don't know well\n[02:48.18] But I was way too high to give a fuck if you couldn't tell\n[Post-Chorus]\n[02:52.32] Drug dealers dealin' out potions\n[02:55.38] Some codeine, some coke ones\n[02:58.76] Demons mixin' in with your emotions\n[03:01.78] But only so long can you still run\n[Verse 4]\n[03:05.18] Woke up, can't breathe\n[03:06.84] It's somethin' to see\n[03:08.24] That the things I need\n[03:11.00] Are just a plea\n[03:12.34] To escape reality\n[03:14.06] To a world make-believe\n[03:15.68] Drugs help you see what they can't see\n[03:18.02] What they won't see\n[03:19.44] Walkin' through the hallway\n[03:21.50] Vision blurry\n[03:23.12] Just like always\n[03:24.80] Thinkin' bout the whole day\n[03:26.84] And I will buy Xans every time I get paid\n[03:31.84] Things change, rearrange\n[03:35.24] Everything, everything\n[03:38.46] Things change, rearrange\n[03:41.86] Everything, everything\n[03:48.38] Things change\n[03:51.68] Things change, rearrange\n[03:55.12] Everything, everything\n[03:57.84] Outro / Chorus\n[03:58.38] In my hotel, saw a gate to hell\n[04:01.00] So gone, I couldn't talk or make a scream for help\n[04:04.42] A lot about that realm I don't know well\n[04:07.68] But I was way too high to give a fuck if you couldn't tell\n[Outro]\n[04:11.68] Drug dealers dealing out potions\n[04:14.84] Some codeine, some coke ones\n[04:18.16] Demons mixing in with your emotions\n[04:21.26] But only so long can you still run\n[04:24.64] Still run","words":[[0.02,0.86,"[Chorus]"],[13.28,13.34,"In"],[13.4,13.42,"my"],[13.66,14.26,"hotel,"],[14.42,14.66,"saw"],[14.74,14.74,"a"],[14.88,15.12,"gate"],[15.24,15.36,"to"],[15.52,15.74,"hell"],[15.88,16.0,"So"],[16.32,16.72,"gone,"]